### 🔐 Register doctor (only saves email, password, role in DB)
POST {{baseUrlAuth}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":     "{{email}}",
  "password":  "{{pwd}}",
  "role":      "doctor"
}

### ✔ Verify e-mail (put here token copy of register)
@verifyToken = 3a0d51b714daa24a8c8b92813f93662f1549771b7caf01cd34d5655765375038

GET {{baseUrlAuth}}/verify-email?token={{verifyToken}}

### 🔑 Login doctor
