### 📋 Get current user permissions
GET {{baseUrlPermissions}}/my-permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ✅ Check specific permission - canViewPatients (should be true for doctor)
GET {{baseUrlPermissions}}/check/canViewPatients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ❌ Check specific permission - canManageSystem (should be false for doctor)
GET {{baseUrlPermissions}}/check/canManageSystem
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 👤 Get complete user information with permissions
GET {{baseUrlPermissions}}/user-info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 🚫 Test endpoint without token (should fail with 401)
GET {{baseUrlPermissions}}/my-permissions

### 🚫 Test endpoint with invalid token (should fail with 403)
GET {{baseUrlPermissions}}/my-permissions
Authorization: Bearer token_invalido

### 🚫 Check non-existent permission (should return false)
GET {{baseUrlPermissions}}/check/permiso_inexistente
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

